Some time ago (it may be as far back as last january) someone
posted a suggestion about having special appenings on certain dates.

Most of us have plenty of free time on holidays to play nethack.
So why not make them special days to play!

For example:
Having a human called Santa-Claus walking around level 1 giving (small)
gifts to all lawful monsters and characters on christmas day.
At easter, easter rabbits hiding easter eggs in corners and closets.
I'm not gonna list all the possibilities here (how could I?), I'll
let the net hammer them out in the religious flame war that will 
follow ;-)

Seriously, Nethack is an *OLD* game. A lot of folklore has been included.
My personnaly favorites are meeting a succubus and offending your god
while reflecting and desintegration-resistant (aldo I thing the gods
aren't though enough yet, but that's another thread altogether).
I think special events would add greatly to this folklore.

Anyways, I've written enough for now.

